FlashCARE Investor Handoff

Open index.html in Chrome, Edge, or Safari to view the full interactive webpage.

Keep the assets folder beside index.html. The page uses those files for the images, logo, and video background.

Recommended for presenting:
1. Unzip the folder first.
2. Open index.html.
3. Use full-screen browser mode.
4. Scroll section by section or use the right-side navigation dots.
